<h2>Cookies on this website</h2>
<p>We don't set any cookies, and we don't use analytics or advertising tools. That's why we don't show a cookie banner.</p>

<h2>Optional features from other websites</h2>
<p>Two features load content from other organisations, and only when you choose to use them:</p>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">When it loads</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Map on the contact page</td><td>OpenStreetMap</td><td>Only after you select "Show map"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Translate menu</td><td>Google Translate</td><td>Only after you choose a language. It opens in a new tab</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>These services may set their own cookies. Please see the <a href="https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy">OpenStreetMap privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a>.</p>
